						 <p>This is really damn good, minus some bits I find weak like the compulsive aspects and the following quote:</p> <blockquote> <p>It should be noted however, that the attractive properties of SCP-2100-J do not dissipate following removal of the item unless a large (upwards of 300m) distance is put between the item and subject.</p> </blockquote> <p>I do think this could perfectly well be a mainlister. It wouldn't prevent an upvote from me, but this is realistic enough to say &quot;Why yes, the Foundation could feasibly contain this&quot; with the right kind of humor too.</p> 
